The aim of this Finance Dashboard is to provide a comprehensive view of
financial and transaction data, enabling users to monitor performance, identify trends, track key metrics, and 
support data-driven business decisions through interactive visualizations.

Tools & Technologies
Power BI – Dashboard development and data visualization
Power Query – Data cleaning and transformation
DAX (Data Analysis Expressions) – Calculated measures and KPIs
Data Modeling – Building relationships between datasets
Key Insights
Financial performance overview through key KPIs and metrics.
Analysis of transaction trends over time.
Identification of high-performing and low-performing categories.
Monitoring of revenue, expenses, and profitability patterns.
Interactive filtering and drill-down capabilities for detailed analysis.
Data-driven insights to support strategic and operational decision-making.
